OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Fand hill snow to start. Through the
OL,7,Fday rain will become confined to the
OL,8,Feast, mainly over Angus. Further west
OL,9,Fwill become dry with some brighter
OL,10,Fintervals.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mostly cloudy night with
OL,13,Fshowers in the east, mainly Angus.
OL,14,FFurther west will be drier and colder
OL,15,Fwith some clear intervals allowing a
OL,16,Ffrost to form.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,177,160,301,260,100,100
