OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F176A1795585659
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA mostly cloudy day with
OL,6,Fsome brighter intervals. A few showers
OL,7,Faround the east in the morning but
OL,8,Fthese gradually easing, remaining dry
OL,9,Felsewhere. Winds strengthening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fwith rain and hill snow spreading
OL,13,Feastwards Friday. Mostly dry and
OL,14,Fcloudy on Saturday, then rain
OL,15,Fovernight. Mostly dry with bright
OL,16,Fspells on Sunday, showers in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
